  "solution": "**Logic :** (1st number - 3rd number) = (2nd number ÷ 7)\n\n**Given : **\n\n \n• (40, 175, 15)\n\n40 - 15 = 175 ÷ 7\n\n25 = 25 (LHS = RHS)\n\n \n• (30, 133, 11)\n\n30 - 11 = 133 ÷ 7\n\n19 = 19 (LHS = RHS)\n\nSo,\n\n \n• Option - (1) : (29, 110, 13)\n\n29 - 13 = 110 ÷ 7\n\n16 ≠ 15.71 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n \n• Option - (2) : (25, 91, 12)\n\n25 - 12 = 91 ÷ 7\n\n**13 = 13 (LHS = RHS) **\n\n \n• Option - (3) : (17, 45, 10)\n\n17 - 10 = 45 ÷ 7\n\n7 ≠ 5 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n \n• Option - (4) : (25, 108, 10)\n\n25 - 10 = 108 ÷ 7\n\n15 ≠ 15.42 (LHS ≠ RHS) \n\nHence, **\"Option - (2)\"** is the correct answer.",
